### Weak Correlations:

| Feature | Correlation Coefficient |
|---------|------------------------|
| **Smoker** | 0.11 |
| **Sex** | 0.086 |
| **MentHlth** (Mental Health) | 0.065 |
| **BMI** (Body Mass Index) | 0.053 |
